 989:./lwip-2.1.2/src/apps/http/httpd.c **** /** Sub-function of http_send(): send dynamic headers
 990:./lwip-2.1.2/src/apps/http/httpd.c ****  *
 991:./lwip-2.1.2/src/apps/http/httpd.c ****  * @returns: - HTTP_NO_DATA_TO_SEND: no new data has been enqueued
 992:./lwip-2.1.2/src/apps/http/httpd.c ****  *           - HTTP_DATA_TO_SEND_CONTINUE: continue with sending HTTP body
 993:./lwip-2.1.2/src/apps/http/httpd.c ****  *           - HTTP_DATA_TO_SEND_BREAK: data has been enqueued, headers pending,
 994:./lwip-2.1.2/src/apps/http/httpd.c ****  *                                      so don't send HTTP body yet
